Who is asking. The name and logo come from the agent's own metadata document:
unverified display data, escaped like any input, and always shown together
with the host the agent is published on, which is what was actually checked.
#}
<div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-4">
    {% if agent.logoUri %}
        <img src="{{ agent.logoUri }}" alt="" width="48" height="48" class="rounded" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
    {% endif %}
    <div>
        <div class="fw-semibold">{{ agent.displayName }}</div>
        <div class="small text-muted">{{ 'koh_poppy.consent.published_on'|trans({'%host%': agent.clientId|split('/')[2]}) }}</div>
    </div>
</div>
